- op: discuss  # c7bd
  at: '2026-03-21T06:04:53Z'  # c7bd
  by: agent  # c7bd
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c7bd
  clock: 2  # c7bd
  nonce: c7bd  # c7bd
  message: "Design task: call edges need directional access_mode annotations. Currently, the calls section was removed from all dataflow patterns because it incorrectly annotated call edges as 'read' (breaking forward slices). The correct approach: annotate the CALLER side as 'write' (writing the return value) and the CALLEE side as 'read' (reading parameters). This requires the annotation engine to understand call direction from the AST context. Medium effort."  # c7bd
